WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.080
Maria, please, save this boy, Zero!

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.000
I am Gekkou!

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.200
I have come forth on the orders of Maria-sama!

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:15.950
Zero?

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:19.540
Don't worry. I'll take care of him.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.790
I'm not Zero right now.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:25.830
I am Kiyo.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:30.000
If we save Zero-kun from slavery, Senpai, will you...

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:34.870
This time, I'm going to help both you and Kiyo-senpai!

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:40.870
We still haven't solved the case of the star symbol SCM,
and Julia and Fujiko are still missing.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.870
What do we do now, Ryuuou?

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:47.450
Julia...

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:51.160
"You're so smart."

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:55.700
Mom always said that to praise me.

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:59.290
"You're so smart, so you'll be okay, right?"

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:03.950
Mom said that and stopped coming home.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:24.050
Ryuuou
Edogawa

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:34.500
Itsuwari mo naku waraeru you na kokoro ga hoshii

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:46.200
Hajime kara nani mo nozomanakerya

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:53.910
Kono kokoro shizumu koto nai no kana

00:01:54.660 --> 00:02:02.790
Aisareru yorokobi nara shitteiru kedo

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:11.370
Monotarinai mitasarenai nayami wa tsukinai

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:17.330
Karakara na kokoro uruoshite kureyo

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:21.120
Afureru hodo yu wo sosoide kure

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:26.700
Munashiku tada hibiku kono sakebigoe

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:32.910
Taikutsu de arifureteiru mainichi demo

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:36.580
Kono mi ni ataerareta koufuku da to

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:49.040
Itsuwari mo naku waraeru you na kokoro ga hoshii

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:58.370
-fall-

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:58.370
Ryuuou? Can you hear me?

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:00.250
What is it?

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:02.120
Here's a status report.

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:08.040
First off, Julia and Fujiko,
who went to infiltrate the school, have gone missing.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:13.410
We also haven't heard anything from Masakazu Meguro,
who we sent to keep watch around the school perimeter.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:18.950
The chances that all three of them have been captured
and enslaved by another are quite high.

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:23.870
We've confirmed three other forces
other than ourselves at this time.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:27.950
First, we have Eia Arakawa and Yuuga Ohta.

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:32.160
Then, we have this Maria person,
who showed up yesterday.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:35.910
Zero was her spy.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:39.370
Lastly, we have the star mark SCM.

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:42.040
We don't know anything about that one.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.790
The question then, Ryuuou,

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:47.290
is what we should do next.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:49.580
Leave it to me.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:52.160
Leave it to you?

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.370
Are you okay, Ryuuou?

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:59.040
You've been all alone since Julia disappeared...

00:03:59.040 --> 00:03:59.660
Stop.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:03.290
Don't worry about me.

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:05.250
I haven't ordered you to do so.

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:10.250
What's up with him?

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:14.790
He's always given us straightforward orders before...

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:19.080
Yeah. At this rate, though...

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:22.540
We might end up having to do something.

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:50.250
For as long as I can remember,
I lived here with my mother.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:53.950
My mother started leaving the house more often for work,

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:56.870
and I spent more and more time alone.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:46.580
Is your mother in?

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:47.750
No.

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:52.000
Could you tell her to call this number
when she gets back?

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:03.620
\ In a bind? /
CALL NERIMA CASHING!
(Muon Group)
Everyone accepted!

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:04.160
MASSAGE PARLOR
GALAXY MAGNUM

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.040
Maneater Health Club
Savanna

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:06.660
Snack bar
JE T'AIME

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:10.660
Maneater Health Club
Savanna

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.830
Umm, is anyone home?

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.160
Hello?

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:50.790
Who're you?

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:53.910
Uh, umm, I'm...

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:59.410
I'm Julia Katsushika.

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:02.080
Ryuuou-kun! Good morning!

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:06.580
Oh, it's nighttime, so good evening, I guess.

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:10.830
Julia Katsushika appeared in my life out of the blue.

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:15.830
Apparently, she'd come to stay
at our place at some point.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:22.790
It was around then that I came into the possession
of two SCMs, which I'd learned about online.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:30.450
I'd gotten them because I was curious, and with
Julia always keeping me company, I decided to test it.

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:35.830
Hey. Strip for me.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:39.700
The SCM was real.

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:44.330
The first thing I thought
when I made Julia my slave was...

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:46.750
I wanted to save Mom.

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:49.250
Mom!

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:54.620
What's all the commotion?

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:58.700
Hmmm.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:01.120
Came to rescue your mother, did you?

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:06.080
Unfortunately, your mommy owes me a lot of money.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:09.290
She can't quit her job here just yet.

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:11.370
How much is it?

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:14.450
How much do I have to pay you to free her?

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:16.750
Let's see...

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:20.950
Pay me a hundred million yen and I'll think about it.

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:27.000
He's the problem.

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:30.250
If I get rid of him, I'll get Mom back.

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.370
I'll use the SCM to do it.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:34.450
Ryuuou-kun...

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.540
Don't touch me!

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.500
It's okay.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:53.500
It's okay. I'm right here.

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:02.330
You're so weird.

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:10.660
After that, I went online and got more SCMs,
then got more slaves.

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:16.500
Through all of it, Julia followed my every order.

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:20.500
She was always right by my side.

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:23.380
Bank Account Balance
Current Balance:

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:25.790
Look, Master Ryuuou, I got a tattoo!

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:29.040
It's a dragon and a cherry blossom,
for your name, Master Ryuuou.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.950
It makes me feel like I'm really your slave,
don't you think?

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:38.160
At some point, she started doing things
I hadn't ordered her to do.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.830
Why is she going so far for me?

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:46.330
Was it because of the SCM?

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:50.330
It needs to cook for a bit, so it's gonna take some time.

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:56.950
You must be pretty hungry!

00:09:56.950 --> 00:10:00.620
But if you eat that, you won't be able to eat your dinner!

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:01.700
You have it.

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:02.290
Huh?

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.580
You can have it.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:08.660
Really?

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:18.370
I suppose it'd be alright if I had a bit.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:43.250
Eia Arakawa?

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.620
What?

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.080
Eat this if you're hungry.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.870
I bought them but I don't need two.

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:54.410
Has she not realized who I am?

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:01.870
Okay, in exchange, why don't you tell me
the name of a book you like?

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:04.620
Look over there.

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:08.620
Why?

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:09.870
Huh?

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:12.160
Why'd you talk to me?

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:15.580
Hmm... No reason.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:25.200
I see you around sometimes, and today
you seemed like you really wanted to eat a nice donut.

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:30.620
Didn't you learn in school never to give candy
to little kids you don't know?

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:33.290
Hold on, isn't that usually the other way around?

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:37.950
Anyway, I just thought that's what I should do.

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:43.040
Lately I've had this policy of doing things
I might worry about later.

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:48.410
I didn't mean to bother you. Sorry.

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:53.040
Hey.

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:56.330
Give me that one instead.

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:57.950
Sure, I guess.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:06.580
Hey.

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:11.620
If you find a cool book on that shelf, let me know.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.370
You recommended those to me
without even reading one?

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.370
I can't reach them.

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:30.660
We're going to take Julia and the others back.

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:32.750
I'll contact you again soon.

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:46.250
So? Where is your master?

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:48.660
I-I can't say...

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:54.290
Master ordered me not to say anything about that!

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:58.250
Welp, then I guess all we can do
is punch the crap outta you.

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:02.620
Meguro's gotta be someone's slave...

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:05.000
Good job catching him, though.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.910
It was real easy figuring out where he was.

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:11.160
We caught him at his usual pachinko parlor.

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:17.000
He's not wearing his SCM,
so we can't force him into a duel.

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:19.660
What should we do, Chuo-san?

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:22.250
He didn't have a phone, either.

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:25.540
You sure he wasn't hiding one anywhere?

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:28.000
Nope, he wasn't.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.040
At least, it wasn't in the clothes he was wearing.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:34.620
Wait...

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:37.370
No! Don't!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:39.040
What's this?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.500
What? Is he packin'?

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:43.080
No...

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:45.750
I found a piece of paper...

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:48.660
No! Don't look at it!

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:52.120
He must've stuffed it into his underwear
when we caught him.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:56.500
Are these your orders from your master?

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:57.090
Tonight, in the dead of night,
Koku-cho, at the Time Bell

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:01.620
The time bell...

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:05.830
This must be the place the note was talking about.

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:10.330
Chuo-san, I see Fujiko Taito.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:12.080
There's a man with her.

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:14.370
I see them on the map.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:19.080
The man is the person
who possesses the star symbol SCM.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.910
Are we really going to do this, Chuo-san?

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:25.120
We don't even know who he is...

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:30.750
He's got Fujiko, which means
he's got to know where Julia is.

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:33.870
We'll get him to talk, even if it means forcing him to.

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:35.500
You ready?

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:36.750
Let's go.

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:41.000
What?!

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:42.790
We're surrounded!

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:48.040
Planning on having a secret tryst here?

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:53.330
Who're you? How did you know to come here?

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.040
You screwed up, didn't you, Meguro?!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.870
Hold it. Don't move.

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:02.950
Whoa, Old Man, that's a nice thing you got there!

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:05.620
I had this gun smuggled in from overseas.

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:08.290
I really hope I don't have to use it.

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:11.870
Are you Ryuuou's pawns?

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:14.660
Yeah. You're wearing an SCM, right?

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:16.580
Okay.

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.660
You're going to duel me and lose.

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:23.950
You're surrounded, so don't think you can get away.

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:25.790
Is Ryuuou not here?

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:27.620
No, why?

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:33.620
I see, so the only ones here are his slaves.

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.660
That is quite convenient.

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:39.870
The sound of a game starting?!

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.790
Hey! What's going on?

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.790
What's the duel even about?!

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:48.080
A duel? I have no need for those.

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:51.040
Not with my Judgement SCM!

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:00.160
What the hell happened?

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:04.410
Did we all just lose?

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:08.410
That's right.

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:12.200
Unfortunately, you've all stepped right into my trap.

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:17.250
Meguro-kun was bait to get you to find me.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:20.700
Of course, I never told him that.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:27.450
But who would have imagined
I could capture so many in a single instant?

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:32.330
Though I suppose you were all destined
to be slaves in the first place.

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:37.330
What the hell can your SCM do?

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:45.050
ATARU CHUO
Incoming Call

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:47.080
Hello?

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:49.580
Nice to meet you, Ryuuou-kun.

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:51.080
Who is this?

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:53.830
My name is Tsubaki Setagaya.

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:57.580
You know about the star symbol SCM, I presume?

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:02.120
I've just taken possession of all of your slaves.

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:05.580
Where's Julia?

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:09.410
Oh, yes, Julia Katsushika-san!

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:15.750
She resisted the call of her SCM for a very long time,

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:19.660
but she's finally knelt at my feet.

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:22.450
She truly is a dutiful slave.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:28.000
A perfect specimen, really,
even offering up her own health to her master.

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:31.950
I would love for you to tell me your secret.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:34.750
How did you train her so well?

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:37.200
Give her back.

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:39.000
Give Julia back to me!

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:43.700
My, my, it seems something I said touched a nerve.

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:49.250
Not to worry, I'll be enslaving you too very soon!

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:52.870
Ryuuou! Hang up!

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:57.330
Oh, my, what an impatient fellow.

00:17:57.450 --> 00:18:02.370
Don't worry, it'll be a while until I make Ryuuou my slave.

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:04.330
Why are you doing this?

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:08.580
I'm collecting all of your SCMs.

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:17.200
What, you didn't think I'd release such an amazing device
out into the world for no reason at all?

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:25.160
Just as I expected, you became the perfect specimens
for collecting data on SCM usage.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:31.910
Thank you so much for dancing
so diligently in the palm of my hand.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:11.370
The plan Kiyo-senpai and I
came up with ended in failure...

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:15.950
We had one chance to make Ryuuou our slave
and have him free Zero-kun...

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:20.660
But now that Kiyo-senpai's secret is out,
we can't take them by surprise anymore.

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:26.450
And Kiyo-senpai hasn't awoken since;
maybe because she overexerted herself.

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:30.450
What should I do?

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:32.700
Maybe...

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:38.000
I should put on the SCM and force Zero-kun
into becoming my slave...

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:43.750
Then I wouldn't have to take out Ryuuou
to free Zero-kun from slavery.

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:48.950
I might be able to save
Kiyo-senpai and Zero-kun like that.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.620
It might be worth a try.

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:05.200
Is that the Proximity Alert?

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:09.870
But Zero-kun's not wearing his SCM...

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:13.000
Someone else is coming close?

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:18.870
Oh, that's right, I sent Gekkou to go get some snacks.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:23.120
What're you gonna do if someone catches you,
running around with your SCM on?

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:24.290
Jeez...

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:28.080
Don't scare me like that.

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:40.000
This guy, Nobita...

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:42.660
He's no good at school, and no good at fighting,

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:45.540
and he can't do shit without his robot.

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:51.160
But he had a special ability. Wanna know what it is?

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:56.200
Shooting.

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:04.040
Listen to the whole story, Fatass.

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:09.290
Y'know, I think if Nobita'd been born in America,

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:12.790
he could've been real famous for his shooting skills.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:18.370
So, what am I trying to say with this story?

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:22.250
Don't look down on me.

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:24.330
I've only got this one bullet.

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:27.910
If you get away, you win. That good?

00:21:28.750 --> 00:21:30.580
Zero-kun's in my room.

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:33.330
I have to get this guy away from here...

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:34.330
Okay.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:38.330
Ready, go!

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:44.250
I have to run as far away as I can to buy some time!

00:21:45.620 --> 00:21:46.950
You're slow as shit.

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:53.200
Sucks to be you.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:55.830
Well, Fatass...

00:21:57.950 --> 00:21:59.500
You lose.

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:05.620
All of you are gonna be my slaves.

00:22:17.340 --> 00:22:20.900
-fall-

00:22:22.910 --> 00:22:27.660
Kyuukyoku no game kokoro o tamesareteru

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:32.450
Ichi tai ichi kara hajimaru kakehiki wa

00:22:32.450 --> 00:22:35.120
